    "preamble": "Bharmal vs State Of Rajasthan (2025:Rj-Jd:18519) on 15 April,",
    "facts": "2. The present bail applications have been filed under Section 483 of Bhartiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita (B.N.S.S.), 2023 on behalf of the petitioners, who are in custody in connection with F.I.R. No.64/2025 dated 07.02.2025, registered at Police Station Sanchore, District Jalore, for the offences under Sections 274, 275, 318(2), 336(2), 342(2), 349(A), 350(1), 61(2)(A) of B.N.S.S., 2023, Section 3 of Food Safety and Standards Act and Section 102, 103 of Trade Marks Act, 1999.",
